# Advent of Code 2025

## Day 1
The problem tells us to count how many times we reach 0 in a define number of movement right and left. We see three main scenerios,
we are between the valid values [0,99], we move too much to the right,overflow over 99,or we move too much to the left, passing 0.
Also, a round is determined by passing 100 cells,se we want to divide the number of rounds and the internal real movement of the input
received.
